# Written as .gitignore into a new Cosmósis project (Cosmósis spec, section 2, "Version
# control"). Everything else in the project is source.

# Sau's cache: the .blend snapshot, thumbnails, undo history. Not the map of handles to
# persistent IDs, which is source (Sau's decisions S61 and S66).
.sau/*
!.sau/ids.noll

# Where the project was left: workspaces, viewport, selection, open files.
/view.noll

# Rendered images and exports.
/renders/
